{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510222","name":"申鹤【彩蛋】","desc":"申鹤彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/24077343/b6f690ced46d0d20fa541da16b946902_4734179624956638685.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e申鹤\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e3月10日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e留云借风真君洞天\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"角色介绍\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e气质出尘的仙家子弟。隐修在璃月群山之间，个性也如仙人般淡漠疏离。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/e2dfeee83654c0a6a7436b7c120c105a_2497967854406351637.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/6281703b41b1d8676eef968b6eca1bd5_2970667486410806482.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e申\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"ajbxr8hedrT1757444565318\",\"child_ids\":{\"ajbxr8hedrT1757444565318\":[]},\"contents\":{\"34d56c3eyyzT1763005347142\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e申鹤：不，已经没关系了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e申鹤：有什么想吃的东西吗？我来帮你们做。在这里帮工期间，我也向卯师傅学了几样手艺。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：咦，真的吗？申鹤都会做什么呀?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e申鹤：比如烤吃虎鱼，还有香嫩椒椒鸡…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：好耶！正好都是我们爱吃的！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e申鹤：嗯。以前你们来的时候，我看你们点过。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e申鹤：稍坐片刻，我来下厨。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ajbxr8hedrT1757444565318\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"rw8rrphjx08T1763005346138\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：有什么心事吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"sp26kir336iT1763005394327\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：我们也来帮忙吧。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e派蒙：没错，大美食家派蒙品尝过无数料理，今天就让我来指点你一下吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：我们上!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：不愧是旅行者，一眨眼就把蔬菜切好了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：等下，火是不是有点大——喂！申鹤，灶台下面冒烟了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e申鹤：不必担心。「寒冰变神」！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：等下，怎么连灶台一起冻住啦！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：嗯…嗯？味道意外的还不错…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：椒椒鸡被冰过之后有一种特殊的口感，难道我们意外发现了新的菜肴？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：真好吃。嘿嘿，你们也快来尝尝看！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e申鹤：好吃就好。下次有机会，我们再一起下厨吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e望发：你好，店里有人在吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：客人渐渐多起来了呢。申鹤是不是也要开始忙了？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e申鹤：嗯，我去看看。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e望发：「夕阳红旅团」？你确定这个名字能吸引人来报名？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e德财：名字可以再议嘛。不过「送长辈出门旅游」，据说也是当代年轻人表达孝心的一种方式，我觉得是个商机。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e德财：…不好意思，点单。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"t40z8u64eaT1763005344404\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：刚刚看你在沉思…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"2upesybrlwT1757444565340\",\"child_ids\":{\"2upesybrlwT1757444565340\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"child_ids\":{\"xwrgz2yd3zbT1757444565362\":[]},\"contents\":{},\"root_id\":\"xwrgz2yd3zbT1757444565362\"}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"d2m5idgjg4T1757444565368\",\"child_ids\":{\"d2m5idgjg4T1757444565368\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e在你那边，过生日的这一天，需要遵循什么习俗吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e以往师父知我不需身外之物，每到此日，只会送上一句祝福。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e因此，生日要吃「长寿面」这种说法，我也是最近才学来的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我无意追求寿命的长度，却想与结缘之人相处得长久。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我向擅长烹饪的师父请教，要怎样才能将它做得足够好吃，师父却希望我自己领悟。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我不知道自己究竟悟出了几分，或许这只能由你来评判。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我等你来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3426\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/03058284b98cc962ec55d9a38176e8bd_5641579431416905309.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"连心面\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e连心面\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1065\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/09/27/75833613/265e4fe6d06ce44f83e85c3dfb9d9982_1139737533713451933.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"骗骗花蜜\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1065/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1065/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e骗骗花蜜\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/f386bba20fe6dedfe78345536865618f_2675864329210186778.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/f386bba20fe6dedfe78345536865618f_2675864329210186778.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/18788987\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e申鹤生日快乐｜能收到你的祝福，我很开心。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"长久…——2022-03-10\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e今日一早，师父特意为我熬了药膳汤，又做了好几道精致的菜肴，还请来了削月筑阳和理水叠山两位真君小聚一番。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e洞府之内，温和的饭菜香气配合熟悉的交谈氛围，令人安心。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我也收集了琉璃袋内凝结的露水，取出了存放许久的甘香药草，制成了简单的茶点。虽不能与师父的厨艺相提并论，但它也代表了我的些许心意…和踏入人世的改变。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e若是你愿在品尝后略作评点，我心中就没有缺憾了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e另外，药膳汤的分量很足。我只盛了一小碗，又将余下的药汤当成汤底，为你做了一碗面…希望你喜欢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"751\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/13/24077343/825512faec7fc2631632d82305ef0edf_9103005364725117347.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"清心\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/751/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/751/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e清心\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3426\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/03058284b98cc962ec55d9a38176e8bd_5641579431416905309.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"连心面\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e连心面\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/7ed9147a892413e05b659729e781150c_51405693635347252.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/7ed9147a892413e05b659729e781150c_51405693635347252.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/36691249\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e申鹤生日快乐｜这种感觉，就像蓝天和春风，还有你送我的花束。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"生辰…——2023-03-10\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e最近这段时日，但凡得闲，我便在一旁观察和学习卯先生的烹饪技法，摘录笔记，由此总结了不少经验。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但当我自己动起手来，却遭遇了重重阻得。比如说拆解鸭骨一不小心就会用力过猛，将鸭肉撕散；制作茶酥时又因为将面皮擀得过薄，最后在包馅时露出里面的馅料…我不想放弃，所以在那之后，我又练习了许多次，香菱和锅巴也给了我不少鼓励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e现在，请你尝尝我的手艺。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500929\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/02/15/75610764/5e00320597e8a2ca35233144b73e19f0_2365659687847527360.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"八宝福禄鸭\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500929/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500929/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e八宝福禄鸭\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3426\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/03058284b98cc962ec55d9a38176e8bd_5641579431416905309.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"连心面\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e连心面\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500720\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/30/75610764/3861ae58da3f0b4cd97d00bd1f060cc9_3794107667890132236.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"茶好月圆\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500720/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500720/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e茶好月圆\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/23f6ffa85bc825f473f45f2ebb6460f7_8730623835321317861.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/23f6ffa85bc825f473f45f2ebb6460f7_8730623835321317861.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/50158220\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e申鹤生日快乐｜对了，要来一杯清心茶么？是你上次给我的配方。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"我的手艺…——2024-03-10\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e不久前，有两位客人在万民堂用餐，那位小姐在离开时对同行的先生哭诉：「只分甘不共苦的感情就像须弥的流沙」…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e起初，我并未洞见其中深意，直至观察身边同伴后才逐渐发觉，亲密的家人间，似乎不只有欢乐的话题。平时，香菱会对卯先生抱怨烹饪难题，而师父也总会叮嘱我，出门在外，如遇烦恼，要及时对她说。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我希望，你我也能达到如此地步。因此，请说出你的烦恼，我会认真聆听，如有需要，我会全力出手。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e至于我的困扰…嗯，不如相见后我再一一坦白吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3426\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/03058284b98cc962ec55d9a38176e8bd_5641579431416905309.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"连心面\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e连心面\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"831\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/26f915d93ca74fc9a520f3a1bdc5427f_3255367856372646779.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「繁荣」的指引\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/831/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/831/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「繁荣」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/1f3fffbfbfc521795b06b5bda1b9b2b8_6594109385640936986.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/14/50494840/1f3fffbfbfc521795b06b5bda1b9b2b8_6594109385640936986.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/62565640\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e申鹤生日快乐｜并非有何要事——只是邀你一同赏月。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"你的烦恼…——2025-03-10\"},{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e不知道为何，最近来店里吃「水煮黑背鲈」的客人格外多。上菜的时候，我看见一名枫丹人把鱼肉先放在白水里涮了一圈，然后才放进嘴里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱时不时就瞟一眼那个客人，手里的锅勺也甩得比平时更用力，最后终于忍不住走上前，问那个客人是不是吃不了辣…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e之后，香菱重新做了一道减辣的「水煮黑背鲈」送给了客人，客人吃得眉开眼笑，差点连盘子里的汁水都喝光了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e……\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e店里闲下来的时候，香菱问我想要什么生日礼物，我说，想请她教我做减辣版的「水煮黑背鲈」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这样，下次你来店里时，无论你喜欢辣还是不辣，我都能做给你吃。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3426\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/03058284b98cc962ec55d9a38176e8bd_5641579431416905309.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"连心面\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3426/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e连心面\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"367\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/19/24077343/1bb52d54eb21e9014f47d577232545d4_1025779635143973719.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"水煮黑背鲈\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/367/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/367/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e水煮黑背鲈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/10/50494840/8d03abde8fbc2b09ddb508c4d891d2b9_2717803198627761832.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/10/50494840/8d03abde8fbc2b09ddb508c4d891d2b9_2717803198627761832.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/73847460\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e申鹤生日快乐 | 既然是你盛情相邀，那试一试倒也无妨。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}],\"tab_name\":\"新菜…——2026-03-10\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8182","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色洞天对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"9mhhnxbrqwmT1757444565346\",\"child_ids\":{\"229unpu2ghcT1757444837228\":[\"ec4kc3v8bwjT1757444843884\"],\"2agzhasbve2T1757444719022\":[],\"53osjjox5h3T1757444807261\":[\"lrubaf2bavoT1757444813182\",\"o274c16z6tT1757444816248\"],\"5cjhqtcuogmT1757444733778\":[],\"9mhhnxbrqwmT1757444565346\":[\"fai5lrke43tT1757444716548\",\"gwhjkkz6nrwT1757444716891\",\"gxxrqnpj8wT1757444717376\",\"dd6v1z4mqphT1757444717849\",\"2agzhasbve2T1757444719022\"],\"d8w51u77y3lT1757445111470\":[],\"d92lc87ux1T1757445020500\":[\"y6xnobb1e5jT1757445040987\"],\"dd6v1z4mqphT1757444717849\":[],\"e13xjbnbbpoT1757444830155\":[\"229unpu2ghcT1757444837228\"],\"ec4kc3v8bwjT1757444843884\":[\"yulwhmo60oT1757444846041\"],\"fai5lrke43tT1757444716548\":[\"htgvj4wjue6T1757444732317\"],\"gwhjkkz6nrwT1757444716891\":[\"hvff70n91yT1757444805422\"],\"gxxrqnpj8wT1757444717376\":[\"d92lc87ux1T1757445020500\"],\"htgvj4wjue6T1757444732317\":[\"5cjhqtcuogmT1757444733778\"],\"hvff70n91yT1757444805422\":[\"53osjjox5h3T1757444807261\",\"wg8orncw0ifT1757444808100\"],\"logcaj5zzvaT1757445071615\":[\"vsqugl82879T1757445082174\",\"wbgzg0bq8uT1757445090124\"],\"lrubaf2bavoT1757444813182\":[\"e13xjbnbbpoT1757444830155\"],\"m7m71uzmofrT1757445062054\":[\"logcaj5zzvaT1757445071615\"],\"o274c16z6tT1757444816248\":[\"e13xjbnbbpoT1757444830155\"],\"ql1o4k2k9mT1757445099153\":[\"d8w51u77y3lT1757445111470\"],\"uv65kwihq9T1757445050829\":[\"logcaj5zzvaT1757445071615\"],\"vsqugl82879T1757445082174\":[\"ql1o4k2k9mT1757445099153\"],\"wbgzg0bq8uT1757445090124\":[\"ql1o4k2k9mT1757445099153\"],\"wg8orncw0ifT1757444808100\":[\"lrubaf2bavoT1757444813182\",\"o274c16z6tT1757444816248\"],\"y6xnobb1e5jT1757445040987\":[\"uv65kwihq9T1757445050829\",\"m7m71uzmofrT1757445062054\"],\"yulwhmo60oT1757444846041\":[]},\"contents\":{\"229unpu2ghcT1757444837228\":{\"option\":\"【我？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嗯。说你在大家眼中是个身手了得的大英雄，然而上次你却惊慌失措地摔下了群玉…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"2agzhasbve2T1757444719022\":{\"option\":\"【晚安，申鹤。】——【夜晚】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e晚安，旅行者，好好休息。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果睡不着，我这里有些宁神助眠的仙草，可以随时找我来取。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e放心，不管多晚，都不会打扰到我休息的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"53osjjox5h3T1757444807261\":{\"option\":\"【怎么调节气氛？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e根据她的说法，聊一些对方感兴趣的人和事，最能调动气氛。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e但在认识你之前，我熟悉的人不多，感兴趣的话题也…几乎没有。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"5cjhqtcuogmT1757444733778\":{\"option\":\"【那我就放心了。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e只是…有许多布设和家具我都未曾见过，不清楚它们的用途和意义…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e等你有空，还请和我说明一下。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9mhhnxbrqwmT1757444565346\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者，辛苦了，欢迎回家。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e听说家人外出归来时，要说这样的话，对吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"d8w51u77y3lT1757445111470\":{\"option\":\"【团团圆圆？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嗯，团团圆圆。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"d92lc87ux1T1757445020500\":{\"option\":\"【肚子饿了吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e其实不太饿…我只是想和你一起坐下来，慢慢地吃顿饭。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我听说「吃饭」在璃月人眼中是件大事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不仅为了填饱肚子，更重要的是，「跟重要的人共享一段温馨时光」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e聚在一起吃饭，这个场面就叫「团圆」。我学的对吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"dd6v1z4mqphT1757444717849\":{\"option\":\"【早啊，申鹤。】——【白天】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者，你已经起来了？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果是鸟儿太吵的话，我去把它们解决掉…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e好吧，就只把它们赶跑，不会伤害它们。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"e13xjbnbbpoT1757444830155\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e但师父和我聊起你时，我会觉得…很有趣。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ec4kc3v8bwjT1757444843884\":{\"option\":\"【好了请别往下说了…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你脸红了。是因为被这个话题调动了情绪吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e看来师父的聊天技巧是有用的…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e明白了，今后我会向师父多多询问你的事情，以便增加我们之间的话题。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"fai5lrke43tT1757444716548\":{\"option\":\"【在这里还习惯吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我原以为这里会跟仙家洞府差不多…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没想到经你改造，跟我想象中大有不同。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"gwhjkkz6nrwT1757444716891\":{\"option\":\"【想一起聊聊天吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e聊天？你也跟师父一样，喜欢聊天吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e也好，修行之外，师父也教过我聊天的技巧。不过大多数时间都是她说，我听。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e难得有实践的机会，请出招。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"gxxrqnpj8wT1757444717376\":{\"option\":\"【有什么想做的吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e嗯，想吃饭。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"htgvj4wjue6T1757444732317\":{\"option\":\"【申鹤更喜欢哪边呢？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯…大多仙人常年云游在外，虽然洞府奇巧别致，但更像是个寂寥的仙境。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e而这里氛围温馨，还有你这样的热心之人作伴。是我从来没有体会过的经历。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e所以，我喜欢这里。我会爱惜这个地方，慢慢适应它。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hvff70n91yT1757444805422\":{\"option\":\"【都有哪些聊天技巧？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔…聊天这种行为和修炼方术不同，似乎没有具体口诀。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e只记得她说过，聊天的目的不仅在于传递信息，还能调节气氛和增进情感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"logcaj5zzvaT1757445071615\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e是吗…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e以前总觉得，任何节日都与我无关，但现在…心中好像有个声音呼唤下个节日早点到来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e想用我学到的东西，和你一起庆祝。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"lrubaf2bavoT1757444813182\":{\"option\":\"【也就是说…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"m7m71uzmofrT1757445062054\":{\"option\":\"【比如逐月节会一起赏月…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"o274c16z6tT1757444816248\":{\"option\":\"【申鹤其实不喜欢聊天…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ql1o4k2k9mT1757445099153\":{\"option\":\"这是因为一直有你指导。我不会忘记你的恩情。  我对你的感情，也不止感激…  总之，下个节日，我们也一起度过吧。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"uv65kwihq9T1757445050829\":{\"option\":\"【也有其他节日…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"vsqugl82879T1757445082174\":{\"option\":\"【不知不觉间…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"wbgzg0bq8uT1757445090124\":{\"option\":\"【申鹤成熟起来了…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"wg8orncw0ifT1757444808100\":{\"option\":\"【怎么增进感情？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e说来惭愧，这方面我没有天赋，没能习得师父半点真传…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e仙人们与我的师徒之情非比寻常，不需要通过聊天来增进。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e除了他们，我也没有其他朋友，所以，没有需要增进感情的对象。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"y6xnobb1e5jT1757445040987\":{\"option\":\"【对，尤其在节日里。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e比如海灯节？我知道会放霄灯，但海灯节一年只有一次。太遗憾了。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"yulwhmo60oT1757444846041\":{\"option\":\"【请不要这样做…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊，也对。你近在咫尺，不必如此麻烦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e那么，请告诉我更多关于你的事情吧，我会牢牢记住的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8227","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/01e4657c4bd836286e8af9e296c2c145_1972101646932014127.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8228","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色赠礼","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"同伴赠礼\",\"header\":[\"好感套装\",\"对应奖励\",\"好感套装对话\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2201\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/26/159922380/db7afc09f11a4c852260df3def2d7786_7359349219852381714.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"百里琳琅街\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2201/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2201/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/26/159922380/db7afc09f11a4c852260df3d